      ":question/problem": "Which of the numbers below belong to $\\mathbb{Q}_0^{+}$?\n\nI. $\\frac{29}{7}$\n\nII. $-\\frac{20}{6}$\n\nIII. $0.5$\n\nIV. $-\\sqrt{36}$",
